<title>LITHUANIA: CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR AUG 12/13.</title>
<headline>CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR AUG 12/13.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania on Tuesday</p>
<p>set the following currency fixings for August 13. The litas is</p>
<p>pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to one.</p>
<p>		   13.08.97	  12.08.97</p>
<p>    USD	  4.0000	    4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	  6.3150	    6.3560</p>
<p>    DEM	  2.1486	    2.1558</p>
<p>    ECU	  4.2254	    4.2422</p>
<p>    100JPY     3.4524	    3.4710</p>
<p>    SEK	  0.4989	    0.5034</p>
<p>    FIM	  0.7186	    0.7216</p>
<p>    EEK	  0.2684	    0.2697</p>
<p>    LAT	  6.8172	    6.8265</p>
<p>    1000RUR    0.6892	    0.6888</p>
<p>    PLN	  1.1442	    1.1531</p>
<p>-- Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
